WEBVTT

00:06.407 --> 00:08.190
Bye!

00:28.539 --> 00:35.525
I saw the shadow falling across your face A quiet

00:35.605 --> 00:44.332
surrender in a crowded place You wore a mask, but

00:44.412 --> 00:52.499
the edges were frayed Lost in the rules of a game

00:52.559 --> 00:59.393
that we played I should have reached out I should

00:59.413 --> 01:05.794
have stood tall But I let the silence echo down

01:05.814 --> 01:09.415
the hall

01:09.875 --> 01:12.556
When the steel doors close and the platform

01:12.636 --> 01:16.057
clears You can hear the truth grinding in the

01:16.097 --> 01:24.437
gears Heed the warning hiding in his eyes Before

01:24.497 --> 01:28.379
the distance leaves your soul behind

01:30.200 --> 01:36.805
Trust the silence when it calls your name Cause

01:36.925 --> 01:41.508
once it's gone, nothing stays the same The

01:47.992 --> 01:54.155
rain on the window is blurring the lines Between

01:54.195 --> 02:01.599
what is real and what we leave behind I traded my

02:01.699 --> 02:08.283
courage for polite little lies And watched as

02:08.323 --> 02:14.546
the storm gathered dark in your skies Now I'm

02:14.566 --> 02:22.224
riding this track to the end of the day Wishing to

02:22.264 --> 02:29.828
God I had pulled you away When the steel doors

02:29.908 --> 02:33.070
close and the platform clears You can hear the

02:33.110 --> 02:37.312
truth grinding in the gears Heed the warning

02:37.412 --> 02:44.875
hiding in his eyes Before the distance leaves

02:44.915 --> 02:52.578
your soul behind Trust the silence When he calls

02:54.179 --> 02:59.562
your name Cause once it's gone Nothing stays the

02:59.622 --> 03:00.082
same

03:26.908 --> 03:30.730
Logic is a cage when the danger is real You can't

03:30.790 --> 03:33.911
code the panic, you can't fake what you feel I'm

03:33.971 --> 03:36.753
turning around, I'm breaking the track

03:37.173 --> 03:39.894
Whatever it costs me, I'm taking it back!

04:07.563 --> 04:10.247
When the steel doors close and the platform

04:10.308 --> 04:13.653
clears You can hear the truth grinding in the

04:13.733 --> 04:21.977
gears Heed the warning hiding in his eyes Before

04:22.017 --> 04:28.240
the distance leaves your soul behind Trust the

04:28.340 --> 04:34.824
silence when it calls your name Cause once it's

04:34.924 --> 04:39.227
gone, nothing stays the same Nothing

04:43.429 --> 04:45.050
stays the same

04:50.355 --> 04:52.708
Listen to the silence

